{'symbol': 'SJM', 'date': '2023-02-08 16:35:00', 'title': 'THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO DIVEST SEVERAL PET FOOD BRANDS AS PART OF CONTINUED PORTFOLIO OPTIMIZATION AND LONG-TERM GROWTH STRATEGY', 'text': 'ORRVILLE, OHIO , FEB. 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. (NYSE: SJM) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO SELL SEVERAL PET FOOD BRANDS TO POST HOLDINGS, INC., A CONSUMER-PACKAGED GOODS HOLDING COMPANY HEADQUARTERED IN ST. LOUIS, MISSOURI.'}